ars on the islands, he discovers friends and wisdom in the most unlikely places. John H. Groberg's Tongan odyssey will change his life forever.","poster":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/8f7f5d35-7335-44a0-b022-5e9d59bf7b35.webp"},"background":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/27f80dec-a1d4-4b9c-82e5-c75fa3b7910b.webp"},"rating":6.3,"cast":[{"id":53761,"name":"Christopher Gorham","role":"John H. Groberg","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dKFXHJ3KBJaeQ50udMdBEC0VFvI.jpg"},{"id":1813,"name":"Anne Hathaway","role":"Jean Sabin","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s6tflSD20MGz04ZR2R1lZvhmC4Y.jpg"},{"id":73889,"name":"Joe Folau","role":"Feki","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uwDx53f5JqidhtCp8SWS6XEbfT8.jpg"},{"id":186450,"name":"Miriama Smith","role":"Lavania","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pBSzslMqid2v6FKvws5KNOaNOoU.jpg"},{"id":2211,"name":"Gerald R. Molen","role":"President Coombs","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m1C2E9MWClm3ITzxQzUxmE1qphL.jpg"},{"id":41784,"name":"Nathaniel Lees","role":"Kelepi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l35ATgC4SbzyKGeAZBAQSyYs18P.jpg"},{"id":2512217,"name":"Alvin Fitisemanu","role":"Tomasi"},{"id":1237634,"name":"Peter Sa'ena Brown","role":"Kuli","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lUdOJMe1GskbgiMXy3UUpxpTzIp.jpg"},{"id":2512218,"name":"Whetū Fala","role":"Asi"},{"id":3495,"name":"John Sumner","role":"President Stone","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rsyOO8YniQa0vQKklUYWYVOUyoO.jpg"},{"id":1358243,"name":"Paula Keenan","role":"Sister Stone","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jg6lznvCfnjJxBKfaAprnDuX5He.jpg"},{"id":181900,"name":"Pua Magasiva","role":"Finau","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r99cVnfis5Sc79sXuRbH2hdfoGC.jpg"},{"id":2829223,"name":"Mary Taio","role":"Lita"},{"id":1237623,"name":"Stig Eldred","role":"Rich Yacht Owner","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9zdyB