etti radicati per guadagnarsi la fiducia e l'amore del popolo di Tonga che è venuto a servire. Durante i suoi tre anni pieni di avventure sulle isole, scopre amici e saggezza nei luoghi più improbabili. L'odissea di John H. Groberg a Tonga cambierà la sua vita per sempre.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"An Epic Journey.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2001-04-12","status":"Released","rating":6.3,"ratingCount":72,"genres":["Avventura","Dramma"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"113m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":53761,"name":"Christopher Gorham","role":"John H. Groberg","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dKFXHJ3KBJaeQ50udMdBEC0VFvI.jpg"},{"id":1813,"name":"Anne Hathaway","role":"Jean Sabin","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s6tflSD20MGz04ZR2R1lZvhmC4Y.jpg"},{"id":73889,"name":"Joe Folau","role":"Feki","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uwDx53f5JqidhtCp8SWS6XEbfT8.jpg"},{"id":186450,"name":"Miriama Smith","role":"Lavania","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pBSzslMqid2v6FKvws5KNOaNOoU.jpg"},{"id":2211,"name":"Gerald R. Molen","role":"President Coombs","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m1C2E9MWClm3ITzxQzUxmE1qphL.jpg"},{"id":41784,"name":"Nathaniel Lees","role":"Kelepi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l35ATgC4SbzyKGeAZBAQSyYs18P.jpg"},{"id":2512217,"name":"Alvin Fitisemanu","role":"Tomasi"},{"id":1237634,"name":"Peter Sa'ena Brown","role":"Kuli","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lUdOJMe1GskbgiMXy3UUpxpTzIp.jpg"},{"id":2512218,"name":"Whetū Fala","role":"Asi"},{"id":3495,"name":"John Sumner","role":"President Stone","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rsyOO8YniQa0vQKklUYWYVOUyoO.jpg"},{"id":1358243,"name":"Paula Keenan","role":"Sister Stone","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jg6lznvCfnjJxBKfaAprnDuX5He.jpg"},{"id":181900,"name":"Pua Magasiva","role":"Finau","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r99cVnfis5Sc79sXuRbH2hdfoGC.jpg"},{"id":2829223,"name":"Mary Taio","role":"Lita"},{"id":1237623,"name":"Stig Eldred","role":"Rich Yacht Owner","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9zdyB8o9XU0G0XpmyRceavuurST.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"L'altro lato del paradiso","overview":"John H. Groberg, un ragazzo della classe media di Idaho Falls, attraversa il Pacifico per diventare un missionario mormone nel remoto ed esotico regno insulare di Tonga durante gli anni '50. Lascia dietro di sé una famiglia amorevole e il vero amore della sua vita, Jean. Attraverso lettere e riflessioni attraverso i chilometri, John condivide le sue avventure umilianti e talvolta esilaranti con \"la ragazza di casa\", e le sue lettere gli sollevano il morale nei momenti difficili. John deve lottare per superare le barriere linguistiche, le difficoltà fisiche e i sospetti radicati per guadagnarsi la fiducia e l'amore del popolo di Tonga che è venuto a servire. Durante i suoi tre anni pieni di avventure sulle isole, scopre amici e saggezza nei luoghi più improbabili. L'odissea di John H. Groberg a Tonga cambierà la sua vita per sempre."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"John H. Groberg, a middle class kid from Idaho Falls, crosses the Pacific to become a Mormon missionary in the remote and exotic Tongan island kingdom during the 1950's. He leaves behind a loving family and the true love of his life, Jean. Through letters and musings across the miles, John shares his humbling and sometimes hilarious adventures with \"the girl back home\", and her letters buoy up his spirits in difficult times. John must struggle to overcome language barriers, physical hardship and deep-rooted suspicion to earn the trust and love of the Tongan people he has come to serve. Throughout his adventure-filled three years on the islands, he discovers friends and wisdom in the most unlikely places. John H. Groberg's Tongan odyssey will change his life forever.","tagline":"An Epic Journey."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rOKZzXOJXfQpLV0VUYVnu0HK8Oc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rOKZzXOJXfQpLV0VUYVnu0HK8Oc.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1jHSJULA0nEDfVeewlLvppsjve8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1jHSJULA0nEDfVeewlLvppsjve8.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gJOk8iJ3OUauwB8Oxn1tVQSL13J.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gJOk8iJ3OUauwB8Oxn1tVQSL13J.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9MfYiummofdtMTOgweXf9yyPl4L.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9MfYiummofdtMTOgweXf9yyPl4L.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gOE0C2j0tv16FagrF0ynfXuPkAG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gOE0C2j0tv16FagrF0ynfXuPkAG.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7tFK7OZHms4QLfV8b6gFxqeMDtg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7tFK7OZHms4QLfV8b6gFxqeMDtg.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/26da3z28tpdWvhg2xtWpoy71RRh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/26da3z28tpdWvhg2xtWpoy71RRh.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cfdKjrZnApHjPauYMsf8qTBv8Po.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cfdKjrZnApHjPauYMsf8qTBv8Po.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jGI7DJ10GVK01RlzBx6pKE9dK6l.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jGI7DJ10GVK01RlzB